<title>PORTUGAL: ICSG organises conference on copper recycling.</title>
<headline>ICSG organises conference on copper recycling.</headline>
<dateline>LISBON 1996-11-01</dateline>
<text>
<p>The International Copper Study Group (ICSG) said it was organising a conference on copper recycling to be held in Brussels on March 3-4 next year.</p>
<p>The conference will focus on the environmental, technological and economic aspects of copper recycling, the Lisbon-based ICSG said in a statement.</p>
<p>-- Lisbon newsroom +351-1-3538254</p>
